{"gems":{"name":"schema_reaper","downloads":428,"version":"1.0.5","version_created_at":"2026-09-04T10:01:25.187Z","version_downloads":4,"platform":"ruby","ruby_abi":null,"authors":"aksshatt","info":"schema_reaper finds schema dead-weight in Rails/ActiveRecord + PostgreSQL apps: dead columns and tables, unused, duplicate and missing foreign-key indexes, and always-NULL or single-value columns. It cross-references the live schema and pg_stats against a static scan of your code, with an optional production runtime signal for higher confidence. Each finding is scored, carries a reclaimable-bytes estimate, and ships with a staged, reversible migration. Reporters for terminal, JSON, Markdown and SARIF; a CI baseline gate; a trend log; a Rails railtie. PostgreSQL only for now; Ruby >= 2.7. See the README for full usage.","licenses":["MIT"],"metadata":{"wiki_uri":"https://github.com/aksshatt/schema_reaper/wiki","funding_uri":"https://github.com/sponsors/aksshatt","homepage_uri":"https://github.com/aksshatt/schema_reaper","changelog_uri":"https://github.com/aksshatt/schema_reaper/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md","bug_tracker_uri":"https://github.com/aksshatt/schema_reaper/issues","source_code_uri":"https://github.com/aksshatt/schema_reaper","allowed_push_host":"https://rubygems.org","documentation_uri":"https://github.com/aksshatt/schema_reaper#readme","rubygems_mfa_required":"true"},"yanked":false,"sha":"9fe9160e6c6810c20f77791ee913b1c678e823c148882082f86f5ebe5479bd6c","spec_sha":"46a675c4286f88c3b3918505317d2ac08fa0d550b7d29b6a480234c180dde6da","project_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/schema_reaper","gem_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/schema_reaper-1.0.5.gem","homepage_uri":"https://github.com/aksshatt/schema_reaper","wiki_uri":"https://github.com/aksshatt/schema_reaper/wiki","documentation_uri":"https://github.com/aksshatt/schema_reaper#readme","mailing_list_uri":null,"source_code_uri":"https://github.com/aksshatt/schema_reaper","bug_tracker_uri":"https://github.com/aksshatt/sche